{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17828","headline":"和裴舍人观田尚书出猎 · 杨巨源","name":"和裴舍人观田尚书出猎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代司空比玉清，雄藩观猎见皇情。\n云禽已觉高无益，霜兔应知狡不成。\n飞鞚拥尘寒草尽，弯弓开月朔风生。\n今朝始贺将军贵，紫禁诗人看斾旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}